    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Egan's are delighted to present this 3 bedroom mid terrace property to the open market for sale. Excellently located on Cathedral View, overlooking the Fairgreen, this property has the benefit of rear access, upgrades to all windows and external doors, with ample on street parking. Accommodation consists of entrance hall, living room, kitchen, bedroom & main bathroom all on ground floor level with two bedrooms located on first floor level.\n\nThis property is conveniently located c. 5 minute walk to Mullingar town centre as well as a host of other services and amenities such as Midlands Regional Hospital, Fairgreen & Tesco shopping centres and Mullingar train station. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
